{"id":"77011268b2b82ae6","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dependent-predicate.md","title":"Dependent predicate","display":"df-dependent-predicate — Dependent predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-dependent-predicate","aliases":["16-df-dependent-predicate","Dependent predicate","16-dependent-predicate"],"display":"df-dependent-predicate — Dependent predicate","depends_on":["[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","[[16-df-fibration]]"],"source":"Definition 11.2.1 p.654 (PDF674); predicates over comprehension contexts","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dependent-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dependent-predicate</span><span>Dependent predicate</span><span>16-dependent-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-predicate — Dependent predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 11.2.1 p.654 (PDF674); predicates over comprehension contexts"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\">\\(\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是同一基底上的谓词纤维化，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)\\)</span> 是本页定义的谓词对象类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_J\">\\(\\mathcal D_J\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 上的纤维。若范畴非小，以下集合构造式按元层类记法读取。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：§11.2、Definition 11.2.1，p.654（PDF674）。依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的谓词位于扩展语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{X\\}\">\\(\\{X\\}\\)</span> 上，类型纤维化与谓词纤维化共用基底 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 塔描述另一种结构，不能作为本书此处 DPL 的接口。参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 决定扩展语境，须显式保留。集合实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma\">\\(P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma\\)</span> 单独见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dfbbd3e4e75d12c7\" href=\"?note=dfbbd3e4e75d12c7\" title=\"16-df-dep-pred-11\">16-df-dep-pred-11</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$，采用 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。$q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B$ 是同一基底上的谓词纤维化，采用 [[16-df-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$，采用 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。$q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B$ 是同一基底上的谓词纤维化，采用 [[16-df-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dep-pred-11","status":"resolved","id":"dfbbd3e4e75d12c7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原来的 $q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E$ 塔描述另一种结构，不能作为本书此处 DPL 的接口。参数 $\\chi$ 决定扩展语境，须显式保留。集合实例 $P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma$ 单独见 [[16-df-dep-pred-11]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_J","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}).","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\{X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1550,"backlinks":[{"id":"fb7afd006e0b80e7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p,\\chi,q,I,X$ 满足 [[16-df-dependent-predicate]] 的同底理解结构及型属条件；$\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})$ 采用该页定义。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-predicate|df-dependent-predicate — Dependent predicate]]"}],"outgoing":["0ba8f021ca287877","c9801f31ec8ac53f","dfbbd3e4e75d12c7"]}